# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AgentPROV .gitignore
# Corpora, raw downloads, upstream clones and secrets are NEVER committed.
# Small, licence-cleared fixtures and golden files under tests/ ARE committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- secrets / local configuration -----------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.netrc
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
*.log

# --- Python / uv --------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.testmondata*
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- AgentPROV data (corpora are released via Zenodo, not Git) ---------------
# Default AGENTPROV_HOME is outside the repository (~/.agentprov); these patterns
# guard against corpora or raw stores being created inside the working tree.
/corpus/
# corpora/ holds committed, data-free build specs (HL H.1.6; MN M.3.1; D-44). Anything else written there is ignored.
/corpora/*/*
!/corpora/*/corpus-spec.toml
!/corpora/*/CARD.md
!/corpora/*/CHANGES.toml
# D-810: persona files (sha256 digests of addresses, never an address) that the specs' [scan] tables reference
!/corpora/personas/*.personas.toml
/out/
/raw/
/staging/
/store/
/upstream/
/runs/
*.aer.jsonl
*.sem.jsonl
*.prov.json
*.prov.trig
*.eval
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zst
*.parquet
# ...except the small, licence-cleared test fixtures and golden files:
!tests/fixtures/**
!tests/golden/**
!docs/architecture/examples/**

# --- editors / OS ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- LaTeX by-products (docs/) ---------------------------------------------------
docs/**/*.aux
docs/**/*.log
docs/**/*.out
docs/**/*.toc
docs/**/*.fls
docs/**/*.fdb_latexmk

# migration (J.2.6, J.1.6): local gate configuration and the isolated baseline environment
migration/local.toml
.baseline/

# --- project website: the build output (landing page + user guide, D-1000); never commit it.
# site/ is the landing page's source and is tracked.
/_site/

# Public repository only (docs/reports/release/public-export.toml): coding-agent files: never committed to the public repository (P-3a, D-1004; user 2026-10-30)
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
/docs/agents/
/docs/review/
/tools/review/
/docs/workflow/
/docs/mac-studio-handoff.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.clinerules
copilot-instructions.md
